  "statuteText": "671:29 Additional Polling Places for Cooperative School Districts. –\n\nThe board of a cooperative school district may authorize the establishment of additional polling places within the building wherein the annual meeting is held. Said additional polling places shall be equipped and laid out in the same manner as the central polling place, and shall be supervised by the election officials of the several towns as provided in RSA 671:26."
